fetch -> ODT fetch); the per-frame compute-combined LUT becomes the upgrade path. S4: the
display target stays R10G10B10A2 - the ODT LUT outputs encoded sRGB and the whole LDR tail
requires [0,1]. OCIO version corrected to 2.5 / studio-config v4.0.0.
Assets/ODT: cubes baked by ReC-Sandbox tools/ocio-bake (commit 238a62f) with provenance
headers: sRGB and Rec.1886 ACES 2.0 SDR 100 nit at 33 and 65, identity LMT.

